# The osce_assessment engine package needs no environment variables.
# Worker packages (livekit_assessment_worker, livekit_assistant_worker) add theirs
# here when they land: LIVEKIT_URL / LIVEKIT_API_KEY / LIVEKIT_API_SECRET,
# LIVEKIT_ASSESSMENT_*_AGENT_NAME, LIVEKIT_ASSISTANT_*_AGENT_NAME, provider keys.
